[by:AISTO]
[ti:No One But You]
[ar:Doug Paisley]
[al:Constant Companion]
[by:AISTO]
[00:35.16]I've seen you stumble, I've seen you fall
[00:39.13]I've seen you brought down
[00:41.15]Feathers and all picked yourself up
[00:43.55]For the ones that you call your best friends
[00:50.27]I know you've been fighting what we can't see
[00:54.11]Sometimes it takes many faces to be
[00:58.15]It takes a time and a place to be free
[01:02.14]But in the end
[01:07.60]Who would be so cruel to someone like you?
[01:12.10]No one but you
[01:15.59]Who would make the rules for the things that you do?
[01:20.09]No one but you
[02:00.66]I woke up this morning, looked at the sky
[02:04.60]I thought of all of the time passing by
[02:08.65]It didn't matter how hard we tried
[02:12.64]'Cause in the end
[02:18.05]Who would be so cruel to someone like you?
[02:22.56]No one but you
[02:25.99]Who would make the rules for the things that you do?
[02:30.49]No one but you
